One small bug to report.  TYT MD-UV380.  After installing the firmware (this occurred on multiple radios of the same model), the "Last Talker" setting under "Display Options" is set to 255.  The maximum intended value for this setting seems to be 30.<br><br>If a user reduces the value from 255, the user cannot increase it until they get to 29.  At that point, the value can be increased to 30 and will not go above 30.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=4474">N3JAS</a> — Wed Jan 22, 2025 6:46 am</p><hr />
